{"version":1,"key":"card:494","content":{"id":494,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3bd531cc-b3c5-4816-baa9-e8a4d71ad28a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"《驱动力》这本书有一个观点很受启发，那就是自主性，我觉得我上班不开心就是缺少自主性，我是一个机器人，只会干活的机器人，所以如果我能改变这种状况，掌握自主性，那么我会不会就变得开心呢？"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"b57d3214-33f2-4aa4-9234-4770788dbbb9","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"27030d69-ca44-4366-8de0-81808b6ce3db","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b084b382-6275-439e-aa1c-62dfe48702ba","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我失去了主动性"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bf59d0bc-3071-43b1-9c29-c738ab36f5d2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我不再主动的将精力投入到项目中，我从事的项目对我而言仅仅是一份工作，我对于工作没有任何的热情"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"bc0a31cc-1c63-4f6d-b4cf-606e1b9b581b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"07d23445-888c-46fa-b44b-1e5948d959ee","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"没有自主性可以掌握"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d4da3d49-66af-420c-ba63-b272c53f6966","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所做的事情都是产品写好的，哪有什么自主性可言"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"accb3830-6c8c-4b4f-b46d-490e57c86769","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"遥想当初入职时的我，精力是多么的充沛，仿佛有干不完的力气，每天都精力十足，不由让现在的我沉思，到底是什么让刚入职的我精力十足呢？我感觉当时有股强大的内驱力让我沉浸其中，但是随着工作中遇到的种种挫折，我变得麻木了。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a6877c92-824f-4b90-b01a-d562f0e92d15","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现在有没有什么破局之法，我觉得在工作上很难了，工作已经很难给到我正反馈了，把工作看作是赚钱的手段，趁着年轻多攒点钱，而快乐得从工作之外去寻找了，我要寻找到我的热爱。"}]},{"type":"highlight-block","color":"blue","tauContract":"8d7373dfc1d83f7abd6f07067a85198c9127dba4aebf48d6d59b33956048da37","collabId":"a13cbaa9-a11f-4485-9aab-461f4b42a73c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8f40e636-6560-4184-b252-e48b0b8d51c9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"专精所以热爱，还是热爱所以专精？"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a7cad58f-25eb-4e1d-a266-830fa0663424","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为专精，所以有很多的正反馈，因此热爱。同样，因为热爱，全身心的投入，所以专精。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"63a7f5b8-4efb-4ee9-8b20-285c26eaa20f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"二者结合就形成了一个反馈，但是如何形成，先热爱还是先专精，按道理由热爱所以专精是一个比较流畅且自然而然的，但是实际大部分的人都是被裹胁着的，读书没得选，专业不喜欢，工作随波逐流，都是在被迫专精，大多数可能是先专精后热爱，只不过这种被迫的专精很难达到专精，因此也就无法产生热爱，这也是大多数人痛苦的原因。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ed576c49-dca6-4acf-872f-b752342af778","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以我比较倾向的是先热爱，所以专精。因为热爱，所以会主动地投入全部的身心，主动地参与产品的建设。想清楚这件事情之后，这将指引我未来的一些选择，比如找工作，既然先热爱，所以工作还是要追求喜欢的、想做的事情，不能因为不是大厂、薪资不高就 Pass 掉，否则人就会一直被套牢，也一直不敢追求自己喜欢的东西。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ef4d8b6a-b2da-437c-9fad-c7fcb01118f3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"人生是旷野，充满着无数的可能，适当的让自己接受失控，让生命自然的流淌，可能会收获意想不到的惊喜。"}]}]}],"tags":["随笔","读书/驱动力"],"createTime":1724215474017,"updateTime":1762049861180,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1762049861180}}